  "question": {
    "text": "A solution is prepared by mixing <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>mol</mi></math>&nbsp;each of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>NaHCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>, and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> in $100 \\mathrm{~mL}$ of water. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>pH</mi></math> of the resulting solution is<br />[Given: <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>pK</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>pK</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>37</mn></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn></math>, respectively.&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>30</mn></math>]",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "10.02",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>First acid base reaction between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>NaOH</mi></math> takes place.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>mole</mi></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><munder><mi>NaOH</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>mole</mi></mrow></munder><mo>&#10230;</mo><munder><munder><msub><mi>NaHCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>-</mo></munder><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>mole</mi></mrow></munder><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>After the acid base reaction, we have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn><mi>mole</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>&nbsp; and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn></math>&nbsp;moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NaHCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>. Here, This will form an acidic buffer&nbsp;of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>NaHCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math>.</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>pK</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>Salt</mi></mfenced><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>Acid</mi></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>01</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>log</mi><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pH</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
